{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-13_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-12","title":"不曾遺忘","storyCode":"16-13","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-13_beg.txt","sourceHash":"badfa25369a1a375a9abffc70b331f37276aff7cd3552ca07c4e7baea7beb980","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Mon3tr結束了變異裂獸的痛苦，三人決定回研究所。Mantra在村莊中確認了聖愚的存在，以及他與內衛之間的連繫。她似乎找到了打破困境的關鍵。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g6_magnetofluidwaterfall"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"牠是不是……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不動了？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像……是這樣沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吼聲，還有那種粗重的呼吸聲都消失了，是我們的攻擊對牠起作用了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是牠還站著，沒有倒下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先不要動！我過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mon3tr確認兩人所在的位置安全後，獨自向前走去。\n數秒前還無比癲狂的裂獸，此時已經被削去了部分體表的源石。牠異常安靜地站立著，就連奇怪的前肢也垂下，凝滯在身前。\nMon3tr小心翼翼地朝牠靠近。\n她觀察著這隻裂獸，原本危險的野獸，軀體上發生的畸變使牠的樣貌詭異萬分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為源石的影響，身體在急速向“人類”的方向轉變……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定很痛苦吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Mon3tr，小心！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"牠又動了！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"narration","text":"但預想中的攻擊並未發生。裂獸沒有移動，而是沉重地、毫無徵兆地向前倒下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到牠的四肢重新接觸大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……Mon3tr，我認為我們應該趁這個機會離開。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"離開這裡，回研究所。現在馬上。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Mon3tr？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠背上甚至還有起伏，牠還在呼吸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且牠聽起來……很痛苦？我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有阿米婭那種感受他人情緒的能力，更何況牠還只是一隻變異的動物，而且……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道就算不管牠，把牠留在這裡，牠也會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石已經刺穿牠的喉嚨，牠全身沒有一處不痛，想把自己已經變異的器官都抓出來卻沒有能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這也是為什麼之前牠會攻擊我們。牠沒辦法控制自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那就結束牠的痛苦吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒錯。我能做到。我能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結束牠的痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她繼續走向倒下的野獸，停在牠的近側，用爪子緊緊貼住一塊少有結晶的皮毛。\nMon3tr望著裂獸，打量牠的身體，眼底只有異樣的平靜。\n然後，她以做微創手術般精準俐落的動作，掐滅了變異裂獸最後的、斷續的喘息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我們走吧，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回研究所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra保持著聆聽狀態。\n她深知自己視野中的景象已不再可信，無論它是遭到了有意的扭曲，還是意外地反映了真實。\n於是她聽著，直到人群之中，最後一句禱詞如同第一片雪花落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“迦弗里伊爾”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就停下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"停止——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一切！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我無權停止，因它從未開始。\n你所見，只是你所想。\n於是Mantra不再嘗試溝通。她向前一步，試圖將那顫動著的紅、白、黑色線條穩定下來。\n然而就在她伸手的瞬間——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忽近忽遠的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才一動不動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來都沒看過你這樣……你怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒有聽見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽見什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"年長的女人沒有立刻回答。\n她環視四周，發現留下的礦工姿態並不像先前那樣如出一轍。眼前的景象令她皺起眉頭，轉而看向自己身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她聽了我的話，跑出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，至少你剛才確實有叫我們離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，但我一點也不記得我為什麼要叫你們離開……這太奇怪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"精神類源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定嗎？我們專門為此訓練過，如果受到這類攻擊，我不會毫無防備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，檢查自己的短期記憶是否遭到了干擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪種干擾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能造成的干擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有次我讓Mechanist忘了去找你是要借用“小樹”和“小軸”的事，本質上不是抹除了那段記憶，而是阻斷了記憶的形成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得……那是你第一次嘗試像這樣使用自己的源石技藝？大腦內的資訊沒有被成功儲存就會造成記憶缺失，也就是遺忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，來自你的提議。在對人體電訊號的瞭解和利用上，你比我更有經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得這裡有人能跟你使用一樣的源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法確定，也可能我只是比你們看到、聽到了更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，烏薩斯的聖愚可能在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚？為什麼突然提起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚在這裡？但烏薩斯僅存的聖愚，兩年前就已經在聖駿堡被燒死了，這麼短的時間之內，有可能誕生另一個聖愚嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。這是我接下來要去確認的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的是聖愚，如果他隱藏在隊伍裡，一路上我卻什麼都沒發現……那就太危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓其他人保持警戒，你也注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前的危險不是物理上的，至少暫時不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果需要，我會及時求助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra轉身，邁向數秒前那紅色曾經存在的位置。\n路上，不斷有擁擠著靠在一起的礦工為她讓出路來，或向她伸出了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您想找……誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還會，離開，去聖駿堡，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會，活、活下去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們，好像，不想離開？我也問了，畢揚叔叔，他不想離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他寧願，讓傷口，爛掉，也……不願再、再逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，活著……難道不比，其他所有事，都重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您，不說話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陌生人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去見娜迦，是不是？那你該膝行過去，仰著頭瞧她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看著她，懺悔，然後得到寬恕。很快你就會發現從前不斷掙扎、始終無法得到平靜的自己，簡直就是愚蠢至極。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra不置可否。她沒有使用源石技藝與這些人對話，只是頷首，而後目不轉睛地盯著房間深處，與他們錯身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你會明白的……等到了她的跟前，你就會明白的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"屋內盡頭，在其他人眼中佝僂而渺小的灰白身影正靜靜坐著，彷彿一尊雕像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——聖愚？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能。絕不可能！聖愚已經死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初陛下出於仁慈，在定罪前允許那個瘋子為自己的罪行進行辯護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果整整七天！整整七天他滴水未進，只為一刻不停地發表詭辯，拖延時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時他甚至還膽敢站在帝國議會的中央，對每一個走進來旁聽的人說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我原諒你”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後陛下忍無可忍，親自宣判了他的死刑，但仍有被他蠱惑的信眾去劫法場，進而爆發了近十年來發生在聖駿堡城區內最大的一場騷亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的這些事我們都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問題在於，如果Mantra說那是聖愚，一定是因為對方露出了可供揣摩的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要做的只是保護好自己，然後等待她的消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra並未像先前礦工說的那樣俯下身去。\n她踏進背光的陰影裡，直視前方，彷彿眼前是一雙回望的眼瞳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你能“聽見”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我聽見，你飽含疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你不是只會模仿我的源石技藝和說話方式，聖愚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“聖愚”……如果你需要我是這個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請解釋這句話的含義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"迦弗里伊爾、索洛米達、貝斯梅特、阿芙羅拉、娜迦……又或者，“聖愚”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有這些，都是“我”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……告訴我，你為什麼要混入這些受苦的人當中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為，這是一場佈道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我將行遍這片廣袤的土地，為了贖去人們遭受的苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也因為，我看見了她，聽見了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我為她的痛苦所挽留，也因此駐足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“她”是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一個受苦的靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你誘騙她，讓她稱你為“娜迦”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我從未誘騙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她像你一樣提問，我像我一般回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有意義的回答。你到底是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也看到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到無序的虛影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在其他人眼中，你不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"世人看到的我的模樣，只反映了他們對我的認知和期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以為，在所有靈魂當中，只有你會理解我為何如此存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是那個未完成的雕像，你曾會成為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我”。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra緊緊盯著眼前詭異的虛影，卻不確定自己能否從那上面看出任何有助於自己判斷的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前，你曾剝除過一塊黑色的腐肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也一樣。它追趕我，我驅逐它，像在呼吸之間從身上割下一塊腐肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒謬的比喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。這只是簡單的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果它已經腐爛，不再與你身體的其他部分同氣連枝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那又為何還要保留？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_29"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……這是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的記憶？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i02"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i03"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但也是我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。內衛……你能影響內衛，你當然也能影響那些礦工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你殺死它。你成為我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是我們之間唯一的共通點，那麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“身體”、“腐肉”。你與內衛的關係——聖愚是內衛實驗的源頭。"},{"type":"narration","text":"從顫動著的虛影之中，不再有聲音傳來。既不辯駁，也不肯定。\nMantra開始後退，離開了陰影的邊緣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……Raidian，我需要支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已確認先前的推測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，補充資訊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚隱藏在礦工之中，幫助他們殺死了內衛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你需要我們怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你繼續想辦法聯絡羅德島在烏薩斯其他地區的支援隊伍，同時請阿米婭拖住阿洛伊澤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在不能馬上離開這裡，至少在我找到能喚醒礦工們的辦法之前不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓極境留在我的源石技藝使用範圍之內，我可能會需要他的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解除聖愚施加在礦工們身上的影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你認為是聖愚控制了這些礦工，讓他們拒絕離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們無法直接殺死聖愚，但他卻隨時可以殺死這裡的每一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……也許阿米婭能幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許可以，但阿米婭並不瞭解聖愚。我不希望她一無所知地捲入其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚與我的能力很相似，這也是為什麼只有我能做出這樣的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他依靠他人的認知建立自身，我需要找到使他建立起“娜迦”這個身分的關鍵，然後才能解除聖愚施加的影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你有懷疑的對象了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra將視線投向四周的礦工，最後落到正從自己身旁經過，走向聖愚的女孩身上。\n她茫然地呢喃著，惶惑而悲傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是需要時間確認。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
